  <item>
    <title>EP17. 由爱生恨，只需要一次无缝衔接---拉子故事会Part2</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68ce2d52a56ca3e0c4594aac</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68ce2d52a56ca3e0c4594aac</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 20 Sep 2025 04:46:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，欢迎来到我们的播客。</span></p><span></span><p><span>好久不见，朋友们！大家期待已久的拉子故事会终于迎来了第二位嘉宾：床单老师！床单老师和侄女在一起的两年多开局有多甜蜜，结局就有多惨烈。以下是本期的shownotes:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="96">01:36</a> 床单老师初登场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a>口罩像是催化剂，感情升温似火箭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="910">15:10</a> 第一次一起过夜 我想睡觉 可是她一直说话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1120">18:40</a> 压死骆驼的最后一根稻草</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1245">20:45</a> 情绪价值供求的不平衡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1352">22:32</a> 友情和爱情的天平到底要怎么平衡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1977">32:57</a> “我答应我妈要去相亲了”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2150">35:50</a> 在我们家的楼下撞见你和别人手拉手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2464">41:04</a> 心甘情愿当小三 争当辛者库贱奴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2747">45:47</a> let it go</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3007">50:07</a> 分手了还要管我的私生活？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3207">53:27</a> 还想用朋友圈刺激我？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3620">60:20</a> 分手还给你当司机 一个愿打一个愿挨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4089">68:09</a> 如果爱了 我愿意再跳侄女的火坑！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4327">72:07</a> 拉子真的别太爱了 帮侄女奶孩子照进现实</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果大家有共鸣和想说的话，欢迎在评论区分享。</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝你有美好的夜晚。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵：Good Luck, Babe!—Chappell Roan</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65cdf1fe3af97665afe68e96/liwpPFjHlMKzxN-pF3C5XJnbheGR.m4a" length="74316505" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:16:35</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvTi2eLwGt0CYtpvc5-y4XiE5lpi.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
