    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，欢迎来到我们的播客。</span></p><span></span><p><span>久违了，朋友们！</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天我们来聊一聊出柜。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="152">2:32</a> “出柜”是不是说出口才算成立？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="351">05:51</a>“我没说，但你听见了吗？”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="391">06:31</a> 出柜的代价：“爱她之后，就失去了ta们”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">12:20</a> 顺从和逃避-也许她不是背叛，而是在求生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1056">17:36</a> 会议室里的彩虹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1340">22:20</a> 不被承认的边缘-“他们不是不懂，只是假装这世界只有一种爱”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1582">26:22</a> 怎么总有人想打开柜门看看里面有什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果大家也有相关的经历或者有关的想法，欢迎在评论区分享。</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝你有美好的夜晚。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵: My Turn--SZA</span></p>]]></description>
